275
00:11:16,777 --> 00:11:18,512
(cat meows)

276
00:11:18,512 --> 00:11:19,713
(dramatic music)

277
00:11:19,713 --> 00:11:22,450
- [Joel] It's the ABC
Movie of the Week.

278
00:11:22,450 --> 00:11:24,885
(Tom laughs)

279
00:11:26,087 --> 00:11:28,722
- [Tom] Hmm, what
pretentious crap.

280
00:11:35,562 --> 00:11:36,697
- [Joel] Well, that
guy's gonna get

281
00:11:36,697 --> 00:11:39,767
